"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Thèid teirmean astar, ceanglaichean gach torrent, sliotan luchdaidh suas is seeding a shuidheachadh airson gach torrent nuair a chuireas tu ris, no nas fhaide air adhart fo Roghainnean Torrent. Cleachdas torrents am pròtacail bhon taba Connection (HTTP no SOCKS5, no pròtacail a' Mac le \"Use the system settings\") agus an teirmean astar airson gach luchdadh a-nuas. Thèid na h-atharrachaidhean an sàs airson torrents a thèid a thòiseachadh às dèidh sin. 'S urrainn do chom-pàirtichean is tracaichean an seòladh IP agad no seòladh a' phròtacail agad fhaicinn.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Na roghainnean a thèid a chleachdadh airson gach luchdadh a-nuas o làrach-lìn. Tha làrach a' gabhail a-steach na fo-fhaclan-lìn aige cuideachd (tha example.com a' gabhail a-steach www.example.com). Cha tèid logadh a-steach ach dhan làrach sin is thèid an cumail còmhla ri ruidhlichean eile an aplacaid.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Bidh lethbhreac-glèidhidh a' cumail na roghainnean agad, roghainnean an làraich, ciùil is liosta nan luchd-ìoslaidh. Cha tèid facal-faire is fiùghantan a chur ann an lethbhreac-glèidhidh.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Nuair a nì thu lethbhreac de cheanglachan a tha a' crìochnachadh ann an aon de na seòrsaichean sin, fosglaidh uinneag a' Chuir ris leis.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "Thèid na suimean-dearbhaidh a tha dùil riutha a dhearbhadh gu fèin-obrachail nuair a chrìochnaicheas luchdadh a-nuas. 'S urrainn do chiùlan an aplacaid fhàgail, a dhol dhan leabaidh no an Mac a mhúchadh nuair a bhios iad deiseil (Sgeamaiche).";
"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Sàbhail am pasgan leudachaidh, fosgail duilleag leudachaidhean a' bhrobhsair, cuir air modh an neach-leasachaidh, tagh Luchdaich gun a dhì-phacadh is tagh am pasgan.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Sàbhail am faidhle a bharrachd is slaod e gu uinneag Firefox. Stàlaichidh Firefox a bharrachd a tha air an sgrìobhadh; faic an README airson an lethbhreac agad a sgrìobhadh.";
"Install the ndm command, then for example: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night" = "Stàlaich an àithne ndm, an uair sin, mar eisimpleir: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night";
